          <mxGeometry height="26" width="700" x="40" y="1680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4-sub" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="What actually happens, step by step, when a class-member trigger fires on these two mismatched states." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="900" x="40" y="1706" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="colA-h" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAF7;strokeColor=#888888;fontStyle=1;align=center;valign=middle;fontSize=12;" value="Flow A — LA has NO Class_Member, session sits in a lesson WITH a class&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:10.5px;color:#666&quot;&gt;→ Section 2 cell M22 (LA–no-ClassMember × Group+class)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="46" width="560" x="40" y="1736" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="colB-h" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAF7;strokeColor=#888888;fontStyle=1;align=center;valign=middle;fontSize=12;" value="Flow B — LA HAS a Class_Member, session sits in a lesson WITHOUT a class&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:10.5px;color:#666&quot;&gt;→ Section 2 cell M13 (LA+ClassMember × Group-no-class)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="46" width="560" x="650" y="1736" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="A1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F0;strokeColor=#888888;align=left;valign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" value="1. State: LA has zero active Class_Member. Staff manually assigns the student into a Group lesson that DOES have a class attached." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="40" y="1800" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="A2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F0;strokeColor=#888888;align=left;valign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" value="2. Student_Sessions__c created directly, Assignment_Source__c = Manual. No Class_Member record involved at all." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="40" y="1900" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="A3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EAD6;strokeColor=#A6721A;align=left;valign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" value="3. A class-member trigger fires later (e.g. Update LA Duration). updateClassMemberAfterChangeLessonAllocationDuration fetches this LA&#39;s Class_Members via getNonDeletedClsMembersByLessonAllocationIds → returns EMPTY." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="560" x="40" y="2000" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="A4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EAD6;strokeColor=#A6721A;align=left;valign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" value="4. modifiedLessonAllocationIds stays empty for this LA → createAssignClassMemberJobs is NEVER called for it. No Master Queue job of any kind is enqueued." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="560" x="40" y="2110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="A5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5EAD6;strokeColor=#A6721A;strokeWidth=2;align=left;valign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" value="Outcome: this session is invisible to the entire class-member trigger apparatus — no automation ever assigns, removes, or re-evaluates it by class/duration match. Only the Manual Session Cleanup engine (LA-end-date based, toggle-gated) can ever touch it." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="560" x="40" y="2220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="B1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F0;strokeColor=#888888;align=left;valign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" value="1. State: LA has an active Class_Member linking to Class X. Staff manually assigns the student into a DIFFERENT lesson that has ZERO Lesson_Schedule_Class__c records (classless lesson)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="650" y="1800" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="B2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F0;strokeColor=#888888;align=left;valign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" value="2. This can ONLY happen via Manual assignment — Auto-assign structurally cannot place a session here: registerLessonStudents requires classIdMapLessons.containsKey(Class X), which is never true for a classless lesson (it has no LSC linking it to any class)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="650" y="1900" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="B3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F0E3;strokeColor=#4C7A3D;align=left;valign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" value="3. A trigger fires that re-scans this LA (e.g. Update LA Duration, or another Class_Member change for the same LA). removeSessionsByClass&#39;s Student_Sessions query filters Assignment_Source__c = Auto FIRST — this Manual session is excluded from the query, never fetched." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="560" x="650" y="2000" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="B4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F0E3;strokeColor=#4C7A3D;align=left;valign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" value="4. Even hypothetically for an Auto session here (not possible per step 2): isLessonGroupWithoutClass would skip it anyway — the LT-108992 fix, evaluated right after the LA-end-date check." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="560" x="650" y="2110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="B5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F0E3;strokeColor=#4C7A3D;strokeWidth=2;align=left;valign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" value="Outcome: doubly protected from the class-matching engine (excluded by origin, and by the classless-lesson guard). Still vulnerable to LA-end-date-shortened removal (Section 3, Row 5) the same as any other session — classless status is irrelevant to that check." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="560" x="650" y="2220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-a1a2" edge="1" parent="1" source="A1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#888888;endArrow=block;" target="A2">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-a2a3" edge="1" parent="1" source="A2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#888888;endArrow=block;" target="A3">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-a3a4" edge="1" parent="1" source="A3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#A6721A;endArrow=block;" target="A4">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-a4a5" edge="1" parent="1" source="A4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#A6721A;endArrow=block;" target="A5">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-b1b2" edge="1" parent="1" source="B1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#888888;endArrow=block;" target="B2">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-b2b3" edge="1" parent="1" source="B2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#888888;endArrow=block;" target="B3">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-b3b4" edge="1" parent="1" source="B3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4C7A3D;endArrow=block;" target="B4">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-b4b5" edge="1" parent="1" source="B4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4C7A3D;endArrow=block;" target="B5">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
